warm windows | ses | warn | footclient | r=0; [ -p "$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/dwl-warm" ] && echo "dwl's fifo (dwl-warm): there" || { echo "dwl's fifo (dwl-warm): missing — dwl without the warm patch"; r=1; }; for n in notes clip system; do p=$(cat "$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/kawa-warm-$n.pid" 2>/dev/null); if [ -n "$p" ] && tr '\0' ' ' <"/proc/$p/cmdline" 2>/dev/null | grep -q -- "--inside $n"; then echo "$n: running, put away or shown"; else echo "$n: not running (closed with Super+Q: its key starts it again)"; r=1; fi; done; exit $r | notes, the clipboard and the system menu kept running, put away — their keys (Super+N, Super+V, Super+U) show them within the frame; dwl's fifo there | log out and in
mako | ses | fail | makoctl | makoctl mode | mako answers on D-Bus | -
